<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '8px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ padding: '30px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>核心四：让显存不随场景线性爆炸</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>09 / 12</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '20px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 26 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: '380px', backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '22px 20px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 74, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>0.5 px</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>屏幕尺寸小于该值、且这类高斯占比超过 20% 时，触发合并</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '1px', backgroundColor: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 16, marginBottom: 14 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 74, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>1 px</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>合并节点的贡献超过该值时，异步回取其子节点（双缓冲防卡顿）</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>合并怎么做</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8 }}>KNN 找 4 个最近高斯，按 KL 散度合并成一个父节点；叶节点参数卸载到 CPU 内存，显存只留活跃部分。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>回环时怎么办</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8 }}>每个高斯记录"出生关键帧"，回环修正时整棵子树按该关键帧的变换异步移动，不必逐个改。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>实测效果（论文）</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8 }}>CityWalk 不用层级：第 <b>795/4050</b> 帧即 OOM；用后峰值高斯 &lt; <b>370 万</b>、显存 &lt; <b>12.8 GB</b>，层级达 <b>8 层</b>。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
